{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994_q001", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1994, "question_number": 1, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限", "连续性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1994_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1994_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q001.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$-2$", "explanation": "要使 $f(x)$ 在 $x=0$ 处连续，需有\n$$\na=\\lim_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\sin 2x+e^{2ax}-1}{x}.\n$$\n由 $\\sin 2x\\sim 2x$，$e^{2ax}-1\\sim 2ax$，得\n$$\na=2+2a,\n$$\n故 $a=-2$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994_q002", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1994, "question_number": 2, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["参数方程", "二阶导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1994_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1994_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q002.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{(t+1)(6t+5)}{t}$", "explanation": "先求\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{dy/dt}{dx/dt}=\\frac{3t^2+2t}{1-\\frac{1}{1+t}}=3t^2+5t+2.\n$$\n再对 $t$ 求导，得\n$$\n\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}=\\frac{6t+5}{1-\\frac{1}{1+t}}=\\frac{(t+1)(6t+5)}{t}.\n$$", "methods": ["隐函数求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994_q003", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1994, "question_number": 3, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["变上限积分", "复合函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1994_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1994_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q003.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$-3\\sin 3x\\,f(\\cos 3x)$", "explanation": "由变上限积分求导公式与链式法则，\n$$\n\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(\\int_0^{\\cos 3x}f(t)\\,dt\\right)=f(\\cos 3x)\\cdot(\\cos 3x)'=-3\\sin 3x\\,f(\\cos 3x).\n$$", "methods": ["变限积分求导", "链式法则", "求导公式"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994_q004", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1994, "question_number": 4, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["不定积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1994_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1994_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q004.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{1}{2}(x^2-1)e^{x^2}+C$", "explanation": "写成\n$$\n\\int x^3e^{x^2}\\,dx=\\frac{1}{2}\\int x^2\\,d(e^{x^2}).\n$$\n作分部积分得\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\int x^2\\,d(e^{x^2})=\\frac{1}{2}\\left[x^2e^{x^2}-\\int e^{x^2}\\,d(x^2)\\right]=\\frac{1}{2}(x^2-1)e^{x^2}+C.\n$$", "methods": ["分部积分"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994_q005", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1994, "question_number": 5, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["可分离变量方程", "微分方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1994_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1994_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q005.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$(x-4)y^4=Cx$", "explanation": "原方程可写成\n$$\n\\frac{dx}{x(x-4)}+\\frac{dy}{y}=0.\n$$\n积分得\n$$\n\\frac{1}{4}\\ln\\left|\\frac{x-4}{x}\\right|+\\ln|y|=C_1.\n$$\n化简为\n$$\n\\frac{x-4}{x}y^4=C,\n$$\n即\n$$\n(x-4)y^4=Cx.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994_q006", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1994, "question_number": 6, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限", "泰勒展开"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1994_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1994_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q006.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "A", "explanation": "由 $\\ln(1+x)=x-\\dfrac{x^2}{2}+o(x^2)$，得\n$$\n\\ln(1+x)-(ax+bx^2)=(1-a)x-\\left(\\frac{1}{2}+b\\right)x^2+o(x^2).\n$$\n由题设应有\n$$\n1-a=0,\\qquad -\\left(\\frac{1}{2}+b\\right)=2.\n$$\n故 $a=1,b=-\\dfrac{5}{2}$，选 A。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994_q007", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1994, "question_number": 7, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["分段函数", "可导性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1994_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1994_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q007.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "左侧函数可导，且\n$$\nf'_-(1)=\\left(\\frac{2}{3}x^3\\right)'\\bigg|_{x=1}=2.\n$$\n又有\n$$\nf(1)=\\frac{2}{3},\\qquad \\lim_{x\\to1^+}f(x)=1\\ne f(1),\n$$\n故 $f$ 在 $x=1$ 右侧不连续，从而右导数不存在，选 B。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994_q008", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1994, "question_number": 8, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["微分方程", "极值"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1994_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1994_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q008.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "在 $x=x_0$ 处有\n$$\nf''(x_0)+f'(x_0)=e^{\\sin x_0}.\n$$\n由 $f'(x_0)=0$ 得\n$$\nf''(x_0)=e^{\\sin x_0}>0.\n$$\n故 $x_0$ 是极小值点，选 C。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994_q009", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1994, "question_number": 9, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["渐近线", "极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1994_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1994_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q009.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "当 $x\\to\\pm\\infty$ 时，$e^{1/x^2}\\to1$，且\n$$\n\\frac{x^2+x+1}{(x-1)(x+2)}\\to1,\n$$\n故有水平渐近线 $y=\\arctan1=\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}$。当 $x\\to0$ 时，\n$$\n\\arctan\\frac{x^2+x+1}{(x-1)(x+2)}\\to\\arctan\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)<0,\n$$\n而 $e^{1/x^2}\\to+\\infty$，故 $y\\to-\\infty$，所以 $x=0$ 是铅直渐近线。$x=1,-2$ 处函数值有界，不是渐近线。故共 2 条，选 B。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994_q010", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1994, "question_number": 10, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分", "奇偶性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1994_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1994_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q010.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "被积函数 $\\dfrac{\\sin x}{1+x^2}\\cos^4x$ 为奇函数，故 $M=0$。又\n$$\nN=\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}\\sin^3x\\,dx+\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}\\cos^4x\\,dx=2\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\cos^4x\\,dx>0,\n$$\n$$\nP=\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}x^2\\sin^3x\\,dx-\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}\\cos^4x\\,dx=-N<0.\n$$\n故 $P<M<N$，选 D。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994_q011", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1994, "question_number": 11, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["复合函数", "二阶导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1994_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1994_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q011.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$y''=\\dfrac{f''}{(1-f')^3}$", "explanation": "对方程 $y=f(x+y)$ 两边对 $x$ 求导，得\n$$\ny'=f'(1+y').\n$$\n故\n$$\ny'=\\frac{f'}{1-f'}.\n$$\n再求导，有\n$$\ny''=f''(1+y')^2+f'y''.\n$$\n移项得\n$$\n(1-f')y''=f''(1+y')^2.\n$$\n而\n$$\n1+y'=1+\\frac{f'}{1-f'}=\\frac{1}{1-f'},\n$$\n所以\n$$\ny''=\\frac{f''}{(1-f')^3}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994_q012", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1994, "question_number": 12, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1994_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1994_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q012.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{3\\pi}{32}$", "explanation": "令 $x^2=\\sin t$，则 $2x\\,dx=\\cos t\\,dt$。当 $x=0$ 时 $t=0$，当 $x=1$ 时 $t=\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}$，故\n$$\n\\int_0^1x(1-x^4)^{3/2}dx=\\frac{1}{2}\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\cos^4t\\,dt.\n$$\n又\n$$\n\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\cos^4t\\,dt=\\frac{3\\pi}{16},\n$$\n故原积分为\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{3\\pi}{16}=\\frac{3\\pi}{32}.\n$$", "methods": ["换元积分"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994_q013", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1994, "question_number": 13, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["重要极限", "三角变换"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1994_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1994_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q013.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$e^4$", "explanation": "利用\n$$\n\\tan\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}+u\\right)=\\frac{1+\\tan u}{1-\\tan u},\n$$\n取 $u=\\dfrac{2}{n}$，得\n$$\n\\tan^n\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}+\\frac{2}{n}\\right)=\\left(1+\\frac{2\\tan(2/n)}{1-\\tan(2/n)}\\right)^n.\n$$\n由 $\\tan(2/n)\\sim 2/n$ 可知\n$$\nn\\cdot\\frac{2\\tan(2/n)}{1-\\tan(2/n)}\\to4,\n$$\n于是由重要极限得原极限为 $e^4$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994_q014", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1994, "question_number": 14, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["不定积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1994_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1994_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q014.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{1}{8}\\left[\\ln(1-\\cos x)-\\ln(1+\\cos x)+\\dfrac{2}{1+\\cos x}\\right]+C$", "explanation": "先化简分母：\n$$\n\\sin2x+2\\sin x=2\\sin x(1+\\cos x).\n$$\n令 $u=\\cos x$，则 $du=-\\sin x\\,dx$，原式化为\n$$\n-\\frac{1}{2}\\int\\frac{du}{(1-u)(1+u)^2}.\n$$\n将被积函数分解为\n$$\n\\frac{1}{(1-u)(1+u)^2}=\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot\\frac{1}{1-u}+\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot\\frac{1}{1+u}+\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{(1+u)^2}.\n$$\n逐项积分后得\n$$\n\\int\\frac{dx}{\\sin2x+2\\sin x}=\\frac{1}{8}\\left[\\ln(1-u)-\\ln(1+u)+\\frac{2}{1+u}\\right]+C.\n$$\n代回 $u=\\cos x$ 即得。", "methods": ["换元积分"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994_q015", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1994, "question_number": 15, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分", "不等式证明"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1994_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1994_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q015.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png", "images/q015_diagram.png"], "answer": "见解析。", "explanation": "由图可知 $C=(0,\\tfrac{1}{2})$，$B=(a,a^2+\\tfrac{1}{2})$。故梯形面积\n$$\nD=\\frac{\\frac{1}{2}+\\left(a^2+\\frac{1}{2}\\right)}{2}\\cdot a=\\frac{a(1+a^2)}{2}.\n$$\n曲边梯形面积\n$$\nD_1=\\int_0^a\\left(x^2+\\frac{1}{2}\\right)dx=\\frac{a^3}{3}+\\frac{a}{2}=\\frac{a(3+2a^2)}{6}.\n$$\n于是\n$$\n\\frac{D}{D_1}=\\frac{3(1+a^2)}{3+2a^2}=\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot\\frac{1+a^2}{\\frac{3}{2}+a^2}<\\frac{3}{2}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994_q016", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1994, "question_number": 16, "question_type": "solution", "score": 9, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["方程根的个数", "导数应用"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1994_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1994_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q016.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$k\\le0$ 或 $k=\\dfrac{2\\sqrt{3}}{9}$", "explanation": "方程可化为\n$$\nkx^3-x^2+1=0.\n$$\n记 $\\varphi(x)=kx^3-x^2+1$。则\n$$\n\\varphi'(x)=3kx^2-2x=x(3kx-2).\n$$\n当 $k\\le0$ 时，对一切 $x>0$ 有 $\\varphi'(x)<0$，故 $\\varphi$ 单调减少，且 $\\varphi(0)=1>0$，在 $x>0$ 上恰有一个零点。\n当 $k>0$ 时，$\\varphi$ 先减后增，极小值在 $x=\\dfrac{2}{3k}$ 处取得。要使正根唯一，必须有极小值为零，即\n$$\n\\varphi\\left(\\frac{2}{3k}\\right)=1-\\frac{4}{27k^2}=0.\n$$\n解得\n$$\nk=\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{9}.\n$$\n综上，\n$$\nk\\le0\\quad\\text{或}\\quad k=\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{9}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994_q017", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1994, "question_number": 17, "question_type": "solution", "score": 9, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["导数应用", "渐近线"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1994_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1994_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q017.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "函数在 $(-\\infty,0)\\cup(2,+\\infty)$ 上单调增加，在 $(0,2)$ 上单调减少；在 $x=2$ 处取极小值 $3$；在 $(-\\infty,0)\\cup(0,+\\infty)$ 上均为凹，无拐点；渐近线为 $x=0$ 与 $y=x$。", "explanation": "函数可化为\n$$\ny=x+\\frac{4}{x^2},\\qquad x\\ne0.\n$$\n故\n$$\ny'=1-\\frac{8}{x^3},\\qquad y''=\\frac{24}{x^4}>0.\n$$\n由 $y'=0$ 得驻点 $x=2$。于是函数在 $(-\\infty,0)$、$(2,+\\infty)$ 上单调增加，在 $(0,2)$ 上单调减少，且\n$$\ny(2)=2+\\frac{4}{4}=3,\n$$\n所以在 $x=2$ 处取极小值 $3$。由于 $y''>0$ 对一切 $x\\ne0$ 成立，所以在 $(-\\infty,0)$ 与 $(0,+\\infty)$ 上均为凹，不存在拐点。\n又\n$$\n\\lim_{x\\to0}y=+\\infty,\n$$\n故 $x=0$ 为铅直渐近线；并且\n$$\n\\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}\\frac{y}{x}=1,\\qquad \\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}(y-x)=0,\n$$\n故斜渐近线为 $y=x$。据此可作出图形。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994_q018", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1994, "question_number": 18, "question_type": "solution", "score": 9, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["二阶常系数非齐次方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1994_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1994_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q018.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\begin{cases}y=C_1\\cos ax+C_2\\sin ax+\\dfrac{\\sin x}{a^2-1},&a\\ne1,\\\\[4pt]y=C_1\\cos x+C_2\\sin x-\\dfrac{x}{2}\\cos x,&a=1.\\end{cases}$", "explanation": "对应齐次方程 $y''+a^2y=0$ 的通解为\n$$\ny_h=C_1\\cos ax+C_2\\sin ax.\n$$\n当 $a\\ne1$ 时，设特解为 $y_p=A\\sin x+B\\cos x$，代入得\n$$\n(a^2-1)A=1,\\qquad (a^2-1)B=0,\n$$\n故\n$$\ny_p=\\frac{\\sin x}{a^2-1}.\n$$\n当 $a=1$ 时发生共振，设特解为\n$$\ny_p=x(A\\sin x+B\\cos x).\n$$\n代入方程得 $A=0,B=-\\dfrac{1}{2}$，于是\n$$\ny_p=-\\frac{x}{2}\\cos x.\n$$\n故所求通解即为题中所示。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994_q019", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1994, "question_number": 19, "question_type": "solution", "score": 9, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分", "不等式证明"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1994_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1994_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q019.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "见解析。", "explanation": "作代换 $x=\\lambda t$，则\n$$\n\\int_0^\\lambda f(x)\\,dx=\\lambda\\int_0^1f(\\lambda t)\\,dt.\n$$\n因此\n$$\n\\int_0^\\lambda f(x)\\,dx-\\lambda\\int_0^1f(x)\\,dx=\\lambda\\int_0^1\\bigl[f(\\lambda t)-f(t)\\bigr]dt.\n$$\n由于 $0<\\lambda<1$，对任意 $t\\in[0,1]$ 都有 $\\lambda t\\le t$，又 $f$ 递减，故\n$$\nf(\\lambda t)\\ge f(t).\n$$\n于是右端非负，从而\n$$\n\\int_0^\\lambda f(x)\\,dx\\ge \\lambda\\int_0^1f(x)\\,dx.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994_q020", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1994", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1994, "question_number": 20, "question_type": "solution", "score": 9, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["旋转体体积", "定积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1994_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1994_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q020.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{448\\pi}{15}$", "explanation": "曲线关于 $y$ 轴对称，且与 $x$ 轴交于 $(-2,0)$、$(2,0)$。只算右半边即可。对 $0\\le x\\le2$，有\n$$\n3-y=|x^2-1|.\n$$\n以竖条作体积微元，得\n$$\ndV=\\pi\\left[3^2-(3-y)^2\\right]dx=\\pi\\left[9-(x^2-1)^2\\right]dx=\\pi(8+2x^2-x^4)dx.\n$$\n故总体积\n$$\nV=2\\pi\\int_0^2(8+2x^2-x^4)dx\n=2\\pi\\left[8x+\\frac{2}{3}x^3-\\frac{1}{5}x^5\\right]_0^2\n=\\frac{448\\pi}{15}.\n$$", "methods": []}
